Changes made: the files listed above are not copies of Formal Conjectures
source files. experiments/lean/referee/extract.py extracted theorem
statements from the Lean sources at the commit above and stored each one
as a JSON record (identifier, module, theorem name, source file, dates
and the extracted source text). The extracted text is the source span
between a theorem's name and its `sorry` proof. In some records of the
pool_*.jsonl files that span runs over neighbouring declarations, so those
records also contain Formal Conjectures definitions, proofs, comments and
docstrings verbatim. The licence headers of the source files are not
included; this notice carries their copyright line.
